    <!-- Team -->
    <msg key="landing.team">Our Team</msg>
    <msg key="landing.team.desc">Since 2016 on the traces of Ludwig Baumann ...</msg>
    <msg key="landing.team.about">From accidental discovery to research project - When we came across the name Ludwig Baumann by chance in 2016, none of us thought that we would one day focus on researching his life and work. All the more reason for us to share the results of our work and to inspire others with enthusiasm for this topic.</msg>
